\begin{abstract}
Using techniques of \cite{BKV}, we construct a perverse $t$-structure on the $\infty$-category of $\ell$-adic $\cL G$-equivariant sheaves on the regular-semisimple bounded locus of the loop group $\cL G$ and prove that the derived $\tau$-coinvariants of affine Grothendieck--Springer sheaves are perverse. Our main new ingredient is a theorem of Yun \cite{Yun} on compatibility of actions.
\end{abstract}

