Namely, both assertions can be either deduced from the results of \cite{KL} and \cite{Be} by the argument of \cite[Appendix~B.2--B.3]{BV}
(using quasi-logarithms and the topological Jordan decomposition) or be obtained in a more general framework of \cite{Bt1} and \cite{Bt2}.

