ence in the $\rho = 0.7$ and separatrix helium measurements. This scaled value is listed in the ``Corrected" row of Table \ref{tab:table_compare}. These modified compression values (listed in the ``Corrected" row of Table \ref{tab:table_compare}) are close in magnitude, indicating good agreement between experiment and simulation.

