Fractions of influx (green), outflux (orange), and intra-flux (blue) WRCs to the aggregate WRC for each of ten groups, i.e., $g^{\alpha}_j$ for $\alpha\in\{\rm in, out, intra\}$ and $j=1,\ldots,10$ in Eq.~\eqref{eq:fract_define}. The group of $j=1$ ($j=10$) indicates the top (bottom) 10\% of all $c_t$ values during the observation period.
}
