\caption{Planet-induced activity in the host star can be probed at different wavelengths. This illustration shows a magnetised planet, but  planets without intrinsic magnetic fields can also induce activity in their host star. Figure reproduced with permission from \citet{2022PhDT.........8K}. Abbreviation: ECMI, electron-cyclotron maser instability. }\label{fig.lambda_kavanagh}
